# Time source for S49ntp.
#
# The dev host, not a public pool: there is no DNS configured on these boards
# (no resolv.conf anywhere in the overlay), so a hostname would not resolve,
# and no route to the internet is wanted or needed.
#
# Syncing both boards to the same local server also makes them agree with EACH
# OTHER, which matters more than absolute accuracy once TX logs on one board
# are being correlated against RX logs on the other.
#
# NOTE this is a DHCP address on the dev host's wifi - if time sync stops
# working, check it is still correct before assuming anything is broken. A
# static lease on the router avoids the problem.
NTP_SERVER=10.0.0.191
